OL,3,GNEWSAHow shifting spit of land became
OL,4,Amillionaire's row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA narrow sandy spit extending into the
OL,7,Fmouth of Poole Harbour is home to some
OL,8,Fof the most expensive homes in England,
OL,9,Fwith its own millionaire's row of
OL,10,Fwaterfront properties.
OL,12,FBut the affluent Sandbanks peninsula
OL,13,Fwas once a wild place of shifting sand
OL,14,Fdunes.
OL,16,FSo how did it become the exclusive and
OL,17,Fexpensive area it is today?
OL,19,FRadio Solent Steve Harris has been
OL,20,Fdelving into its history with Jeremy
OL,21,FWaters, who arrived in a very different
OL,22,FSandbanks as a boy in the 1950s.
